      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>B\u012bre</em>:\u00a0It is a town in\u00a0<em data-start=\"36\" data-end=\"52\">Jund Qinnasr\u012bn</em>, that is, one of the parts of Aleppo. It is a port on the Euphrates River. To go to <span>Diy\u0101r Bakr and Baghdad, one passes through there</span>. Its fortress, as well as its gardens and orchards, are plentiful. (Translated to English by the first contributor of the name entry.)</p>",
